content:
Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Ranch Owner",
      "description": "person responsible for ranch strategy and oversight"
    },
    {
      "name": "Breeding Goal",
      "description": "target outcomes for herd growth and genetics"
    },
    {
      "name": "Budget Plan",
      "description": "planned costs and financial limits for ranch operations"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sales Report",
      "description": "summary of sales outcomes and revenue details"
    },
    {
      "name": "Herd Manager",
      "description": "person managing daily herd operations"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pasture",
      "description": "grazing area used to distribute cattle",
      "attributes": [
        "Cattle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cattle",
      "description": "individual animals in the herd"
    },
    {
      "name": "Cattle Movement",
      "description": "record of where cattle are moved"
    },
    {
      "name": "Livestock Count",
      "description": "total number of cattle tracked on the ranch",
      "attributes": [
        "Cattle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Birth Record",
      "description": "record of newborn cattle"
    },
    {
      "name": "Veterinarian",
      "description": "specialist maintaining herd health"
    },
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "description": "inspection of cattle health status"
    },
    {
      "name": "Vaccination",
      "description": "applied vaccine given to cattle"
    },
    {
      "name": "Treatment Plan",
      "description": "recommended care steps for health issues"
    },
    {
      "name": "Feeding Coordinator",
      "description": "person planning and supervising feed routines"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ration Schedule",
      "description": "planned feeding routine for cattle",
      "attributes": [
        "Feed Intake"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Feed Intake",
      "description": "amount of feed consumed by cattle"
    },
    {
      "name": "Feed Order",
      "description": "request for purchased feed"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sales Agent",
      "description": "person handling cattle sales and buyer communication"
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery",
      "description": "transport of cattle to buyers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Buyer",
      "description": "customer purchasing cattle",
      "attributes": [
        "Client Record"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Client Record",
      "description": "information about buyer interactions and history"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name the two related objects and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

